    <bpmn:process id="W_W4677" name="W4677. Physical Security Architecture, Access Control &amp; Guard-Force Standards (Enterprise)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New site/building (VS-37/VS-138); standard refresh; audit finding
Frequency: Per new site + periodic standard refresh
Volume: ~205 sites (200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ) + executive residences/events
Owner: CSO / Corporate Physical Security Manager
Participants: Facilities (VS-138), Store Ops (VS-07), LP (VS-23), guard agencies (W4680)
Source: workflow W4677 — Physical Security Architecture, Access Control &amp; Guard-Force Standards (Enterprise)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4677_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4677_Lane1" name="Corporate Physical Security Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4677_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4677_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4677_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4677_Lane2" name="CSO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4677_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4677_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4677_Start4" name="New site/building (VS-37/VS-138); standard refresh; audit finding">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4677_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4677_Task5" name="Set enterprise physical-security standards (access-control system, CCTV…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set enterprise physical-security standards (access-control system, CCTV coverage and retention, perimeter, intrusion detection, visitor management) for HQ/executive sites above the store/DC baseline (VS-07 W71/VS-04 W797); govern the enterprise access-control/CCTV platform
Responsible (R): Corporate Physical Security Manager / CSO
Accountable (A): CSO
Duration: Per standard refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4677_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4677_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4677_Task6" name="Set guard-force standards (posting, training, arming posture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Set guard-force standards (posting, training, arming posture, command-and-control, vetting); define the guard agency SLA and oversight (W4680); coordinate guard response with the GSOC (W4676)
Responsible (R): CSO / Guard-Agency Mgr
Accountable (A): CSO
Duration: Per standard</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4677_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4677_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4677_Task7" name="Apply standards to new sites (VS-37 store opening / VS-138 facilities) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Apply standards to new sites (VS-37 store opening / VS-138 facilities) and refresh at existing sites; assure via VS-21.3 W358 physical-security audit
Responsible (R): Corporate Physical Security Manager
Accountable (A): CSO
Duration: Per site + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4677_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4677_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4677_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4677_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-166 (ensure executive-protection &amp; travel-risk control.) | - CTL-707: enterprise physical-security standards; guard-force vetting/training; assured via VS-21.3 W358
Owner: CSO / Corporate Physical Security Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
