    <bpmn:process id="W_W4678" name="W4678. Executive &amp; Principal Threat Profile, Risk Register &amp; Quarterly Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Principal change; quarterly review; threat indicator
Frequency: Per principal + quarterly review
Volume: ~ board + C-suite + family principals (~10–20 profiles)
Owner: CSO / EP Lead
Participants: Protective Intelligence (W4674), Legal (VS-100.3), Insurance (VS-26 K&amp;R), principals&#x27; offices
Source: workflow W4678 — Executive &amp; Principal Threat Profile, Risk Register &amp; Quarterly Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4678_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4678_Lane1" name="EP Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4678_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4678_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4678_Lane2" name="CSO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4678_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4678_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4678_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4678_Start4" name="Principal change; quarterly review; threat indicator">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4678_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4678_Task5" name="Maintain a threat profile per principal (exposure from role, wealth, public…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain a threat profile per principal (exposure from role, wealth, public profile, travel, family, residence, recent events/decisions that could attract threat); set the baseline protective posture
Responsible (R): EP Lead / Protective Intelligence
Accountable (A): CSO
Duration: Per principal + quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4678_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4678_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4678_Task6" name="Maintain the principal-risk register entry in the ERM (VS-21.2); review…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain the principal-risk register entry in the ERM (VS-21.2); review quarterly with the Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk and principals&#x27; offices; adjust posture on threat change
Responsible (R): CSO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Accountable (A): CEO / Board Risk Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4678_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4678_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4678_Task7" name="Coordinate K&amp;R insurance coverage adequacy (VS-26), privacy of principal data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinate K&amp;R insurance coverage adequacy (VS-26), privacy of principal data (VS-91), and Legal liaison (VS-100.3) for any threat-related matter
Responsible (R): CSO / Insurance / Legal
Accountable (A): CSO / VP Legal
Duration: Quarterly + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4678_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4678_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4678_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4678_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-166 (ensure executive-protection &amp; travel-risk control.) | - CTL-707: profiles reviewed quarterly + on event; K&amp;R coverage adequacy assessed; principal data privacy-governed (VS-91)
Owner: CSO / EP Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
